<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: New Irish cabinet list.</title>
<headline>New Irish cabinet list.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the cabinet list issued by Bertie Ahern after he was voted Prime Minister of a minority Irish government on Thursday:</p>
<p>Prime Minister			  Bertie Ahern</p>
<p>Deputy Prime Minister		 Mary Harney</p>
<p>Enterprise and Employment	   Mary Harney</p>
<p>Marine				    Michael Woods</p>
<p>Foreign Affairs			 Ray Burke</p>
<p>Transport, Energy, Telecommunications  Mary O'Rourke Defence				   David Andrews</p>
<p>Agriculture, Food, Forestry	 Joe Walsh</p>
<p>Finance				  Charlie McCreevy</p>
<p>Health				    Brian Cowan</p>
<p>Environment			     Noel Dempsey</p>
<p>Social Welfare			  Dermot Ahern</p>
<p>Arts, Culture, Gaeltacht (Irish)  Sile de Valera Justice, Equality, Law Reform     John O'Donoghue</p>
<p>Tourism, Trade			  Jim McDaid</p>
<p>Education				 Michael Martin</p>
</text>
